Description: Tell the person when the guest's picture cannot be shown
 .
 A GL scanout that cannot be imported left the viewer black, and the
 only word of it was a log line nobody sees. The viewer now shows a
 short message over the black picture: what failed, in plain words,
 and what to do (the Wayland session, or QT_XCB_GL_INTEGRATION=xcb_egl
 where Qt's GLX integration gives no EGL display). It goes away when an
 import succeeds.
 .
 The log line is written once for each distinct width, height, format
 and modifier, not for every scanout record the guest sends.
